@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Employee|
start
:Search product by name or item number;

|System|
:Search product;
if (Product found?) then ([yes])
  :Calculate available stock\n(stock - reserved);
  :Show stock and locations;
  |Employee|
  :Enter requested quantity;
  |System|
  if (Requested quantity > available stock?) then ([yes])
    :Register backorder;
    stop
  else ([no])
    :Show that requested quantity is available;
    stop
  endif
else ([no])
  :Show message product not found;
  stop
endif
@enduml